sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design from ADR 0244: native Swamp schedules, nothing installed on the Node; DECISIONS R1-R3.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Target Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: schedule:destroy<br/>{schedule: 7f3c…}
  Note over GW: Mark Schedule removing<br/>no new fire is recorded
  GW->>SW: Remove the trigger<br/>trigger removal frame (TBD)
  alt removal confirmed
    SW-->>GW: trigger gone
    GW->>SW: Empty the command key<br/>vault: schedule-command-7f3c…
    Note over GW: Delete the Schedule<br/>its tasks stay as history
    GW-->>CLI: Schedule destroyed<br/>204 No Content
  else Swamp does not confirm
    SW--xGW: no confirmation
    Note over GW: Keep Schedule removing<br/>repeat destroy to converge
    GW--xCLI: 503 removal unconfirmed<br/>swamp.schedule_publish_unavailable
  end
  opt a fire is still running
    SW->>N: Finish the running fire<br/>@swamp/ssh, own timeout
    GW->>SW: Read the final run<br/>shared run reader
  end
